ang_notes":[],"note_content":"封丘、襄邑二縣屬陳留郡；寧陵縣屬梁國。宋白曰：封丘，古封國之地，左傳所謂「封父之繁弱」是也，漢爲封丘縣。寧陵縣，古甯城，漢高祖改爲寧陵縣。","note_content_jianti_auto":"封丘、襄邑二县属陈留郡；宁陵县属梁国。宋白曰：封丘，古封国之地，左传所谓「封父之繁弱」是也，汉为封丘县。宁陵县，古宁城，汉高祖改为宁陵县。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":57,"tongjian_id":"985a6bee-db0e-11ef-be81-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"陰陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"阴陵","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"985a6c00-db0e-11ef-9c40-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"壽春","place_name_jianti_auto":"寿春","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"985a6c01-db0e-11ef-ad0b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"九江郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"九江郡","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"985a6c02-db0e-11ef-90d6-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"壽春","place_name_jianti_auto":"寿春","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"985a6c03-db0e-11ef-ae1f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"揚州","place_name_jianti_auto":"扬州","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"985a6c04-db0e-11ef-ae78-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"陰陵、壽春二縣，皆屬九江郡。壽春，揚州刺史治所。復，扶又翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"阴陵、寿春二县，皆属九江郡。寿春，扬州刺史治所。复，扶又翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":99,"tongjian_id":"985a6bff-db0e-11ef-8e13-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"陽翟縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"阳翟县","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"985a6c06-db0e-11ef-8446-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"潁川郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"颍川郡","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"985a6c07-db0e-11ef-be47-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"陽翟縣，屬潁川郡。","note_content_jianti_auto":"阳翟县，属颍川郡。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":139,"tongjian_id":"985a6c05-db0e-11ef-a9fb-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"985a6be4-db0e-11ef-9f6b-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"zhēn","source_anchor_text":"下曹操軍甄城袁術為","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":4,"text":"甄","tongjian_id":"c7b132a2-8590-5087-abaa-79f36e8f9dc8"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"襄邑","place_name_jianti_auto":"襄邑","resolved_place_entity_id":1701,"start_index":49,"tongjian_id":"985ca252-db0e-11ef-afeb-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/二、凤阳府（卷二十一）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"晋仍属淮南郡。宋后县废。梁置北谯郡，治阴陵故城。天监五年...","context_before":"...即项王败至阴陵迷失道处也。汉置县，属九江郡。后汉为郡治。","source_end_index":68,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"3e60b700-2e5d-51f7-9f30-70a70d634761","source_start_index":44,"source_text":"初平四年，袁术保阴陵，集兵淮北，进向寿春，即此。"},{"context_after":"]。魏曰淮南郡，仍置扬州为重镇。西晋因之[平吴后，扬州治...","context_before":"...南王，都寿春]。武帝复为九江郡。后汉因之，兼置扬州治焉[","source_end_index":140,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"969248a7-8fd8-5f10-82a8-4fea7d17faa8","source_start_index":115,"source_text":"袁术为曹操所败，奔九江，寻僣号，以九江太守为淮南尹"},{"context_after":"魏甘露二年，诸葛诞据寿春，文钦自吴驰救，诞寻以猜疑杀钦，...","context_before":"...，即此。寻为九江郡治。后汉建武五年，幸寿春，寻为扬州治。","source_end_index":75,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"25741a03-d6b4-5bdd-8a99-a15119c2309b","source_start_index":56,"source_text":"后汉末为袁术所据，曹操得之，以为重镇。"}],"path":"南直方舆纪要/二、凤阳府（卷二十一）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/一、开封府（卷四十七）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"晋属陈留国。大兴三年，祖逖遣其将韩潜屯于此，既而石勒遣石...","context_before":"...父国。《左传》赐封父之繁弱，是也。汉置封丘县，属陈留郡。","source_end_index":88,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"ef39ac8a-50ec-5157-9960-e7c2478d542f","source_start_index":64,"source_text":"后汉初平四年，袁术屯封丘，曹操自鄄城引兵击走之。"},{"context_after":"，即此]。","context_before":"○黑山[在县北五里。","source_end_index":36,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"a94bd780-67f2-5572-bd23-978da1e5defb","source_start_index":10,"source_text":"后汉初平四年，袁术引军屯于黑山，曹操断术粮道，术败走"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/一、开封府（卷四十七）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/六、归德府（卷五十）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"唐至德初，张巡自雍丘东守宁陵，大破贼将杨朝宗等于此，即今...","context_before":"...楚之际，周市欲立故魏公子宁陵君咎为王，即此。汉置宁陵县。","source_end_index":91,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"72cdbbdb-6cd7-5ccc-90d9-f7e79e2c2846","source_start_index":67,"source_text":"后汉初平四年，曹操败袁术于封丘，术自襄邑走宁陵。"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/六、归德府（卷五十）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"3曹操軍甄城。袁術爲劉表所逼，引兵屯封丘，黑山別部及匈奴於扶羅皆附之。曹操擊破術軍，遂圍封丘；術走襄邑，又走寧陵。操追擊，連破之。術走九江，揚州刺史陳瑀拒術不納。術退保陰陵，集兵於淮北，復進向壽春；瑀懼，走歸下邳，術遂領其州，兼稱徐州伯。李傕欲結術爲援，以術爲左將軍，封陽翟侯，假節。","content_fanyi":"曹操驻军甄城。袁术遭荆州刺史刘表军队逼迫，率兵驻守封丘，黑山军的一部与南匈奴单于於扶罗都归附袁术。曹操击败袁术军，随即包围封丘；袁术逃往襄邑，又逃到宁陵。曹操追击，接连打败袁术。袁术逃到九江，扬州刺史陈瑀率兵抵御袁术，不肯接纳他入境。袁术退守阴陵，在淮北集结兵力，又向寿春进军；陈瑀害怕，逃回下邳，袁术于是占据扬州，兼称徐州伯。李傕想结交袁术作为外援，任命袁术为左将军，封为阳翟侯，并假节。","content_jianti_auto":"3曹操军甄城。袁术为刘表所逼，引兵屯封丘，黑山别部及匈奴于扶罗皆附之。曹操击破术军，遂围封丘；术走襄邑，又走宁陵。操追击，连破之。术走九江，扬州刺史陈瑀拒术不纳。术退保阴陵，集兵于淮北，复进向寿春；瑀惧，走归下邳，术遂领其州，兼称徐州伯。李傕欲结术为援，以术为左将军，封阳翟侯，假节。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":5242,"number":3,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第六十 (漢紀五十二) / 孝獻皇帝乙 / 四年 / 第 3 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"985a6be4-db0e-11ef-9f6b-a0d3651f611f","year_int":193},"tongjian_id":"985a6be4-db0e-11ef-9f6b-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"襄邑","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"襄邑","place_name_jianti_auto":"襄邑","resolved_place_entity_id":1701,"start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"9a686ce9-db0e-11ef-b41b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"7甲午，帝行如襄邑。","content_fanyi":"三月三十日甲午，魏文帝出巡来到襄邑。","content_jianti_auto":"7甲午，帝行如襄邑。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"