_name":"襄邑","place_name_jianti_auto":"襄邑","resolved_place_entity_id":1701,"start_index":142,"tongjian_id":"a276cbbe-db0e-11ef-8f37-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"襄邑","place_name_jianti_auto":"襄邑","resolved_place_entity_id":1701,"start_index":157,"tongjian_id":"a276cbc7-db0e-11ef-b190-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/二、凤阳府（卷二十一）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"。晋末县废，而谯城如故。刘宋亦置谯郡，又侨置陈留郡，治小...","context_before":"...初，陷于石勒。永和五年，复归于晋。升平三年，没于慕容燕。","source_end_index":278,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"d6e86039-b465-5e31-bdd1-d07588e3e06e","source_start_index":229,"source_text":"太和四年，桓温伐燕，遣豫州刺史袁真出寿春，克谯及梁，时苻秦救燕，温还师至谯，为秦将苟池所邀击，大败"}],"path":"南直方舆纪要/二、凤阳府（卷二十一）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/一、开封府（卷四十七）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"后又为姚秦所得，置兖州于此。义熙十三年，刘裕伐秦，沈林子...","context_before":"...年，晋将谢施屯仓垣，寻使荥阳太守刘遁守此。后没于慕容燕。","source_end_index":229,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"fdc826aa-3a6a-5f92-aa85-a91b24255ab9","source_start_index":201,"source_text":"太和四年，桓温伐燕，不克，奔还，自东燕出仓垣，凿井而饮。"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/一、开封府（卷四十七）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/六、归德府（卷五十）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"]。","context_before":"东涧[在州东。","source_end_index":51,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"04c64c81-fa2d-5ec3-bbda-b40b838510dc","source_start_index":7,"source_text":"晋太和四年，桓温伐燕，不克而还，燕兵追之，及于襄邑。慕容德伏兵东涧中，与慕容垂夹击温处也"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/六、归德府（卷五十）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"溫自東燕出倉垣，鑿井而飲，行七百餘里。燕之諸將爭欲追之，吳王垂曰：「不可，溫初退惶恐，必嚴設警備，簡精銳爲後拒，擊之未必得志，不如緩之。彼幸吾未至，必晝夜疾趨，俟其士衆力盡氣衰，然後擊之，無不克矣。」乃帥八千騎徐行躡其後。溫果兼道而進。數日，垂告諸將曰：「溫可擊矣。」乃急追之，及溫於襄邑。范陽王德先帥勁騎四千伏於襄邑東澗中，與垂夾擊溫，大破之，斬首三萬級。秦苟池邀擊溫於譙，又破之，死者復以萬計。孫元遂據武陽以拒燕，燕左衞將軍孟高討擒之。","content_fanyi":"东晋大将军桓温从东燕出了仓垣，一路上掘井取水饮用，行军七百余里。前燕众将领都争着要追击他，吴王慕容垂说：“不可，桓温刚刚退兵，惊恐不安，必定会严加警戒防备，挑选精锐士兵断后，现在攻打他未必能如愿，不如暂缓一下。他庆幸我们尚未赶到，必定昼夜兼程急行，等到他的部队力气耗尽、士气低落，然后再攻打他，就没有不能战胜的了。”于是慕容垂率领八千骑兵缓缓跟进，尾随在桓温之后。桓温果然兼程赶路。过了几天，慕容垂告诉众将领说：“可以攻打桓温了。”于是急速追击，在襄邑追上了桓温。范阳王慕容德事先率领四千精锐骑兵埋伏在襄邑东面的山涧中，与慕容垂夹击桓温，大破桓温军，斩首三万级。前秦人苟池在谯郡截击桓温，又击败了他，战死的士兵又数以万计。孙元于是占据武阳抵抗前燕，前燕左卫将军孟高讨伐并擒获了他。","content_jianti_auto":"温自东燕出仓垣，凿井而饮，行七百余里。燕之诸将争欲追之，吴王垂曰：「不可，温初退惶恐，必严设警备，简精锐为后拒，击之未必得志，不如缓之。彼幸吾未至，必昼夜疾趋，俟其士众力尽气衰，然后击之，无不克矣。」乃帅八千骑徐行蹑其后。温果兼道而进。数日，垂告诸将曰：「温可击矣。」乃急追之，及温于襄邑。范阳王德先帅劲骑四千伏于襄邑东涧中，与垂夹击温，大破之，斩首三万级。秦苟池邀击温于谯，又破之，死者复以万计。孙元遂据武阳以拒燕，燕左衞将军孟高讨擒之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":8948,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百二 (晉紀二十四) / 海西公下 / 太和四年 / 第 12 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"a276cbab-db0e-11ef-9b4b-a0d3651f611f","year_int":369},"tongjian_id":"a276cbab-db0e-11ef-9b4b-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":3},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"襄邑","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"立効，句絕。椎，擣也，直擣其鋒也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"立効，句绝。椎，捣也，直捣其锋也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"a27a84ab-db0e-11ef-9c2e-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"數，所角翻。爭，讀如字。","note_content_jianti_auto":"数，所角翻。争，读如字。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":73,"tongjian_id":"a27a84ac-db0e-11ef-aff5-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[{"relation_type":"explicit_reference","source_end_index":11,"source_start_index":0,"source_text":"事見一百卷穆帝升平元年","target_paragraph_tongjian_id":"a2196108-db0e-11ef-9405-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"穆帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"穆帝","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"a27a84ae-db0e-11ef-9556-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"事見一百卷穆帝升平元年。惡，烏路翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"事见一百卷穆帝升平元年。恶，乌路翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":83,"tongjian_id":"a27a84ad-db0e-11ef-8b97-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"兵法曰：先發制人，後發者人制之。","note_content_jianti_auto":"兵法曰：先发制人，后发者人制之。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":120,"tongjian_id":"a27a84af-db0e-11ef-b1d5-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"可足渾后","people_name_jianti_auto":"可足浑后","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"a27a84b2-db0e-11ef-9939-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"內意，謂可足渾后之意也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"内意，谓可足浑后之意也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":179,"tongjian_id":"a27a84b1-db0e-11ef-85bd-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"襄邑","place_name_jianti_auto":"襄邑","resolved_place_entity_id":1701,"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"a27a84b8-db0e-11ef-a923-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"容斋随笔/昏主弃功臣","excerpts":[{"context_after":"。朱泚据京都，德宗播迁奉天，李怀光继叛，李晟孤军坚壁，竟...","context_before":"...桓温伐慕容暐，暐兵屡挫，议欲奔北，慕容垂一战，使燕复存，","source_end_index":135,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"012cef01-64c9-4612-82dc-e78e38af28d3","source_start_index":117,"source_text":"乃用慕容评之毁，垂窜身苻氏，国随以亡"}],"path":"五笔/卷一/昏主弃功臣","source_name":"容斋随笔"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"6吳王垂自襄邑還鄴，威名益振，太傅評愈忌之。垂奏「所募將士忘身立効，將軍孫蓋等椎鋒陷陳，應蒙殊賞。」評皆抑而不行。垂數以爲言，與評廷爭，怨隙愈深。太后可足渾氏素惡垂，毀其戰功，與評密謀誅之。太宰恪之子楷及垂舅蘭建知之，以告垂曰：「先發制人，但除評及樂安王臧，餘無能爲矣。」垂曰：「骨肉相殘而首亂於國，吾有死而已，不忍爲也。」頃之，二人又以告，曰：「內意已決，不可不早發。」垂曰：「必不可彌縫，吾寧避之於外，餘非所議。」","content_fanyi":"前燕吴王慕容垂从襄邑回到邺城，威名更加显赫，太傅慕容评也更加忌恨他。慕容垂上奏说：“所招募的将士舍生忘死，建立战功，将军孙盖等人冲锋陷阵，应当蒙受特殊奖赏。”慕容评都压住不予办理。慕容垂多次为此陈说，并与慕容评在朝堂上争执，双方的怨恨和隔阂越来越深。太后可足浑氏一向厌恶慕容垂，诋毁他的战功，与慕容评密谋杀掉他。太宰慕容恪的儿子慕容楷和慕容垂的舅舅兰建知道此事，便来告诉慕容垂说：“先发制人，只要除掉慕容评和乐安王慕容臧，其余的人就无能为力了。”慕容垂说：“骨肉之间互相残杀，并且在国中带头作乱，我只有一死罢了，不忍心去做这样的事。”不久，两人又前来报告，说：“可足浑氏已经下了决心，不能不及早动手了。”慕容垂说：“如果一定无法弥补裂痕，我宁愿到外地躲避他们，其余不是我要商议的了。”","content_jianti_auto":"6吴王垂自襄邑还邺，威名益振，太傅评愈忌之。垂奏「所募将士忘身立効，将军孙盖等椎锋陷陈，应蒙殊赏。」评皆抑而不行。垂数以为言，与评廷争，怨隙愈深。太后可足浑氏素恶垂，毁其战功，与评密谋诛之。太宰恪之子楷及垂舅兰建知之，以告垂曰：「先发制人，但除评及乐安王臧，余无能为矣。」垂曰：「骨肉相残而首乱于国，吾有死而已，不忍为也。」顷之，二人又以告，曰：「内意已决，不可不早发。」垂曰：「必不可弥缝，吾宁避之于外，余非所议。」","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":8957,"number":6,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百二 (晉紀二十四) / 海西公下 / 太和四年 / 第 21 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"a27a84aa-db0e-11ef-af73-a0d3651f611f","year_int":369},"tongjian_id":"a27a84aa-db0e-11ef-af73-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":4},{"mention_count":2,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"襄邑","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"莊周","people_name_jianti_auto":"庄周","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"a67033d1-db0e-11ef-a0f6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"漆丘","place_name_jianti_auto":"漆丘","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"a67033d2-db0e-11ef-aa02-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"梁郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"梁郡","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"a67033d3-db0e-11ef-85bb-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蒙縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"蒙县","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"a67033d4-db0e-11ef-9c73-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蒙","place_name_jianti_auto":"蒙","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"a67033d5-db0e-11ef-ab40-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漆丘","place_name_jianti_auto":"漆丘","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"a67033d6-db0e-11ef-9d57-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"漆丘蓋在梁郡蒙縣。昔莊周爲蒙漆園吏，後人因以漆丘名城。將，卽亮翻。降，戶江翻；下同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"漆丘盖在梁郡蒙县。昔庄周为蒙漆园吏，后人因以漆丘名城。将，即亮翻。降，户江翻；下同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"a67033d0-db0e-11ef-b911-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"蔡平侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"蔡平侯","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"a67033d8-db0e-11ef-b129-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"晉惠帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"晋惠帝","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"a67033d9-db0e-11ef-a7f9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"新蔡縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"新蔡县","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"a67033da-db0e-11ef-84fe-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"a67033db-db0e-11ef-b610-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"汝南郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"汝南郡","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"a67033dc-db0e-11ef-8187-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蔡","place_name_jianti_auto":"蔡","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"a67033dd-db0e-11ef-aea8-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"新蔡","place_name_jianti_auto":"新蔡","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"a67033de-db0e-11ef-8be6-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"a67033df-db0e-11ef-80cc-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"汝陰郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"汝阴郡","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"a67033e0-db0e-11ef-9f3e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"汝陰","place_name_jianti_auto":"汝阴","start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"a67033e1-db0e-11ef-aaf8-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"新蔡郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"新蔡郡","start_index":37,"tongjian_id":"a67033e2-db0e-11ef-bd1c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"新蔡縣，漢屬汝南郡。蔡平侯自蔡徙此，故曰新蔡。魏分屬汝陰郡，晉惠帝分汝陰立新蔡郡。","note_content_jianti_auto":"新蔡县，汉属汝南郡。蔡平侯自蔡徙此，故曰新蔡。魏分属汝阴郡，晋惠帝分汝阴立新蔡郡。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":59,"tongjian_id":"a67033d7-db0e-11ef-9048-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"襄邑","place_name_jianti_auto":"襄邑","resolved_place_entity_id":1701,"start_index":99,"tongjian_id":"a6727d9b-db0e-11ef-b1f8-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"襄邑","place_name_jianti_auto":"襄邑","resolved_place_entity_id":1701,"start_index":147,"tongjian_id":"a6727d9f-db0e-11ef-92b4-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/四、南北朝 隋（卷四）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"","context_before":"...之道]。纵诸营屯望风奔溃。龄石趣成都，纵走死，蜀地悉平。","source_end_index":940,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"9a19ec0f-c342-58e4-9058-ac1965631626","source_start_index":430,"source_text":"十二年，姚兴死，裕遂伐秦。遣王镇恶、檀道济将步军自淮、肥向许、洛[自淮、肥者，由寿春而北也。许，许昌。洛，洛阳]，朱超石、胡藩趋阳城[超石时为新野太守，盖自南阳北出。阳城，今河南府登封县]，沈田子、傅弘之趋武关[自出襄阳引军西北也。武关，见前]，沈林子、刘遵考帅水军出石门，自汴入河[遵考时为彭内史，盖自彭城入汴。石门，水入河之门也，亦谓之荥口。见前七国魏苏代论荥口]，以王仲德督前锋，开巨野入河[巨野，见《职方》兖州浸]。镇恶等入秦境，所向克捷，漆丘、项城降[漆丘，今归德府南二十五里小蒙城是。项城，见晋豫州治]，拔新蔡、许昌，克仓垣[仓垣，在开封府陈留县西]，荥阳、阳城皆来降，进至成皋。王仲德水军入河逼魏滑台，魏人弃城走，遂入据之。道济等进逼洛阳，洛阳降，进军渑池[今河南府属县，见前]，径攻潼关，屡败秦兵。裕亦将水军自淮、泗入清河[即巨野以北之济水也]，溯河西上，而遣别将留守碻磝[今济南府长清县西有碻磝故城]，以防魏人侵轶，寻入洛阳，自陕抵潼关。沈田子等亦入武关，大败秦军于青泥[青泥城，在西安府蓝田县南七里]。王镇恶复请帅水师自河入渭，趋长安，破秦军于渭桥[东渭桥也，在西安府东北五十里]。遂克长安，姚泓降。"}],"path":"历代州域形势纪要/四、南北朝 隋（卷四）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/一、开封府（卷四十七）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"宋永初三年，魏将滑稽陷仓垣，陈留太守严棱降，魏仍置陈留郡...","context_before":"...还，自东燕出仓垣，凿井而饮。后又为姚秦所得，置兖州于此。","source_end_index":266,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"fdc826aa-3a6a-5f92-aa85-a91b24255ab9","source_start_index":243,"source_text":"义熙十三年，刘裕伐秦，沈林子自汴入河，克仓垣。"},{"context_after":"宋永初三年，魏将叔孙建自平原济河，徇青、兖，豫州刺史刘粹...","context_before":"...。寻为豫州治。大元八年，苻秦大举入寇，坚发长安，至项城。","source_end_index":190,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"74aa0d40-ba86-575e-825b-13073be468f8","source_start_index":158,"source_text":"义熙十二年，刘裕伐秦，前锋檀道济入秦境，秦徐州刺史姚掌以项城降。"},{"context_after":"宋景平初，为魏所陷，颍川太守李元德复袭取之。既而魏将周几...","context_before":"...，秦灭燕，属于秦。太元九年，复归于晋。隆安中，陷于姚秦。","source_end_index":285,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"3c47853d-8744-578b-b1b7-cd608297009a","source_start_index":256,"source_text":"义熙十二年，刘裕伐秦，前锋檀道济克秦许昌，获颍川太守姚垣。"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/一、开封府（卷四十七）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/六、归德府（卷五十）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"铚城，见江南宿州。○贳城，在府西北。《左传》僖二年，齐侯...","context_before":"...二十五里。《志》云：中有漆园。庄周尝为园人城，亦名漆丘。","source_end_index":244,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"52850c67-ae85-5174-90a0-f12a66524f14","source_start_index":213,"source_text":"晋义熙十二年，刘裕遣王镇恶等入秦境，秦将王苟生以漆丘降，即此。"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/六、归德府（卷五十）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"王鎭惡、道濟入秦境，所向皆捷。秦將王苟生以漆丘降鎭惡，徐州刺史姚掌以項城降道濟，諸屯守皆望風款附。惟新蔡太守董遵不下，道濟攻拔其城，執遵，殺之。進克許昌，獲秦潁川太守姚垣及大將楊業。沈林子自汴入河，襄邑人董神虎聚衆千餘人來降，太尉裕版爲參軍。林子與神虎共攻倉垣，克之，秦兗州刺史韋華降。神虎擅還襄邑，林子殺之。","content_fanyi":"王镇恶、檀道济进入后秦境内，所到之处都接连告捷。后秦将领王苟生献出漆丘，向王镇恶投降；后秦徐州刺史姚掌献出项城，向檀道济投降，其余各处屯守将领都听到东晋军队的风声前来归附。只有新蔡太守董遵不肯降服，檀道济攻下他据守的城池，俘虏了董遵，将他斩杀。接着又进军攻克许昌，俘获后秦颍川太守姚垣和大将杨业。沈林子从汴水进入黄河，襄邑人董神虎聚集部众一千多人前来投降，太尉刘裕任命他为参军。沈林子与董神虎共同攻打仓垣，攻克该城，后秦兖州刺史韦华投降。董神虎擅自返回襄邑，沈林子将他杀死。","content_jianti_auto":"王镇恶、道济入秦境，所向皆捷。秦将王苟生以漆丘降镇恶，徐州刺史姚掌以项城降道济，诸屯守皆望风款附。惟新蔡太守董遵不下，道济攻拔其城，执遵，杀之。进克许昌，获秦颍川太守姚垣及大将杨业。沈林子自汴入河，襄邑人董神虎聚众千余人来降，太尉裕版为参军。林子与神虎共攻仓垣，克之，秦兖州刺史韦华降。神虎擅还襄邑，林子杀之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":10618,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百一十七 (晉紀三十九) / 安皇帝壬 / 十二年 / 第 28 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"a67033cf-db0e-11ef-9fc7-a0d3651f611f","year_int":416},"tongjian_id":"a67033cf-db0e-11ef-9fc7-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":5},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"襄邑","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"讚","people_name_jianti_auto":"赞","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"a69be829-db0e-11ef-a72f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"a69be82a-db0e-11ef-b834-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"襄邑","place_name_jianti_auto":"襄邑","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"a69be82b-db0e-11ef-ae72-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"讚，秦之襄邑令也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"赞，秦之襄邑令也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"a69be828-db0e-11ef-88c4-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"襄邑","place_name_jianti_auto":"襄邑","resolved_place_entity_id":1701,"start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"a69be830-db0e-11ef-983b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"25秦、雍人千餘家推襄邑令上谷寇讚爲主以降於魏，魏主嗣拜讚魏郡太守。久之，秦、雍人流入魏之河南、滎陽、河內者，戶以萬數，嗣乃置南雍州，以讚爲刺史，封河南公，治洛陽；立雍州郡縣以撫之。讚善於招懷，流民歸之者，三倍其初。","content_fanyi":"秦州、雍州一千多户人家推举襄邑令、上谷人寇讚为首领，归降北魏，北魏国主拓跋嗣任命寇讚为魏郡太守。时间久了，秦州、雍州流亡到北魏河南、荥阳、河内一带的民户数以万计。拓跋嗣于是设置南雍州，任命寇讚为南雍州刺史，封河南公，治所设在洛阳；又设立雍州郡县来安抚他们。寇讚善于招纳安抚，流民归附他的，达到起初的三倍。","content_jianti_auto":"25秦、雍人千余家推襄邑令上谷寇赞为主以降于魏，魏主嗣拜赞魏郡太守。久之，秦、雍人流入魏之河南、荥阳、河内者，户以万数，嗣乃置南雍州，以赞为刺史，封河南公，治洛阳；立雍州郡县以抚之。赞善于招怀，流民归之者，三倍其初。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":10690,"number":25,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百一十八 (晉紀四十) / 安皇帝癸 / 義熙十三年 / 第 57 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":56,"tongjian_id":"a69be827-db0e-11ef-ad61-a0d3651f611f","year_int":417},"tongjian_id":"a69be827-db0e-11ef-ad61-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":6},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"襄邑","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"襄邑縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"襄邑县","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"bbfb228a-db0e-11ef-bec4-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"bbfb228b-db0e-11ef-a378-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"晉","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"bbfb228c-db0e-11ef-86e4-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"陳留郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"陈留郡","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"bbfb228d-db0e-11ef-ac68-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"後魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"后魏","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"bbfb228e-db0e-11ef-9cd3-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"陽夏郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"阳夏郡","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"bbfb228f-db0e-11ef-b4c2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"後齊","place_name_jianti_auto":"后齐","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"bbfb2290-db0e-11ef-884e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"隋","place_name_jianti_auto":"隋","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"bbfb2291-db0e-11ef-9c3c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"宋州","place_name_jianti_auto":"宋州","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"bbfb2292-db0e-11ef-8747-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"襄陽縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"襄阳县","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"bbfb2293-db0e-11ef-b1bd-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"襄州","place_name_jianti_auto":"襄州","start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"bbfb2294-db0e-11ef-a433-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"襄邑縣，漢、晉屬陳留郡，後魏屬陽夏郡，後齊廢，隋開皇十六年復置，屬宋州。襄陽縣帶襄州。","note_content_jianti_auto":"襄邑县，汉、晋属陈留郡，后魏属阳夏郡，后齐废，隋开皇十六年复置，属宋州。襄阳县带襄州。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"bbfb2289-db0e-11ef-8e5e-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[{"relation_type":"explicit_reference","source_end_index":15,"source_start_index":0,"source_text":"梅福事見三十一卷漢成帝永始三年","target_paragraph_tongjian_id":"92034c65-db0e-11ef-987c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"梅福","people_name_jianti_auto":"梅福","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"bbfb2296-db0e-11ef-96bc-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"漢成帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"汉成帝","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"bbfb2297-db0e-11ef-8d92-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"梅福事見三十一卷漢成帝永始三年。","note_content_jianti_auto":"梅福事见三十一卷汉成帝永始三年。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"bbfb2295-db0e-11ef-a083-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"襄邑","place_name_jianti_auto":"襄邑","place_note":"河南省睢县","resolved_place_entity_id":1701,"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"bbfb2299-db0e-11ef-94b7-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"容斋随笔/父子忠邪","excerpts":[{"context_after":"，唯刘向勤勤恳恳，上封事极谏，至云：“事势不两大，王氏与...","context_before":"汉王氏擅国，","source_end_index":14,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"4ea8d6f5-2aeb-45a5-b3cd-10c6c52ba016","source_start_index":6,"source_text":"王章、梅福尝言之"}],"path":"续笔/卷二/父子忠邪","source_name":"容斋随笔"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"襄邑尉襄陽席豫聞安樂公主求爲太女，歎曰：「梅福譏切王氏，獨何人哉！」乃上書請立太子，言甚深切。太平公主欲表爲諫官，豫恥之，逃去。","content_fanyi":"襄邑县尉襄阳人席豫听说安乐公主请求中宗立她为皇太女，叹息说：“西汉南昌尉梅福曾深刻讥讽汉成帝冤杀京兆尹王章、切责外戚王氏专权，那是多么特立独行的人啊！”于是上书请求及早册立太子，言辞十分深切诚恳。太平公主想上表请求让席豫担任朝廷谏官，席豫以此为耻，弃官逃离而去。","content_jianti_auto":"襄邑尉襄阳席豫闻安乐公主求为太女，叹曰：「梅福讥切王氏，独何人哉！」乃上书请立太子，言甚深切。太平公主欲表为谏官，豫耻之，逃去。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":20797,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二百八 (唐紀二十四) / 中宗大和大聖大昭孝皇帝中 / 景龍元年 / 第 16 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"bbfb2288-db0e-11ef-af35-a0d3651f611f","year_int":707}